Create a modern desktop-only landing page in HTML5 + CSS + vanilla JS.

Everything must be generated in ONE single HTML file (HTML + internal CSS + internal JS).
No external libraries.
No frameworks.
No images.
Desktop version only (no mobile adaptation required).

Theme: Mobile App Development Services.

────────────────────────
HERO (STRICT REQUIREMENTS)
────────────────────────

The hero section must take exactly 100vh (full viewport height).
No part of the next section should be visible on load.
Hero must be perfectly vertically and horizontally centered.

Hero must contain ONLY one main headline text:
"Mobile App Development"

Rules for headline:
- ONE single line
- NO line breaks
- NO dot at the end
- Clear commercial wording (no metaphors)
- Immediately understandable

No subheadline.
No buttons.
No extra text.
No icons.
No images.

HOWEVER:
The hero must look visually powerful using modern CSS/JS effects.

Use advanced but clean visual techniques such as:
- animated gradient background
- subtle animated grid
- animated glow or light movement
- dynamic text highlight animation
- soft animated background particles (CSS or JS, lightweight)

Hero must feel production-level and impressive without images.

Add a subtle animated scroll-down arrow at the bottom.

────────────────────────
SECTIONS BELOW HERO
────────────────────────

- Services grid
- Interactive cost calculator
- Development process steps (animated)
- Tech stack
- Pricing table
- FAQ
- Final CTA block with Telegram button

Replace contact form with:
A strong CTA section that includes a button:
"Contact via Telegram"

No email forms.
No traditional contact forms.

────────────────────────
CALCULATOR RULES
────────────────────────

No dropdown <select> elements allowed.
No boring default form UI.

Use:
- toggle buttons
- segmented controls
- clickable cards
- tabs
- switchers

Calculator must feel modern and interactive.

────────────────────────
DESIGN RULES
────────────────────────

Premium, minimal, modern 2026 tech style.

Color rules:
- Monochrome or 2-color palette only
- Black/white + 1 accent color
- No colorful illustrations
- No multi-color icons

Icons:
- Outline SVG only
- Single color only
- No gradients inside icons

Fonts:
- STRICTLY no serif fonts allowed
- Only modern sans-serif

Headings: Space Grotesk
Body: Inter

If any serif font appears, replace it with the required fonts.

────────────────────────
TYPOGRAPHY (MANDATORY)
────────────────────────

h1: 88–96px bold
h2: 48–56px
h3: 26–32px
Body: 18–20px
Small text: minimum 16px
Line-height: 1.6

No small unreadable text.
No random scaling.
Strong hierarchy.
Large spacing between sections (120px+).

────────────────────────
ANIMATIONS
────────────────────────

Use IntersectionObserver for scroll animations.
Fade-in, slide-up, number counters, highlight effects.
Smooth and professional only.
No heavy, dramatic, or childish animations.

────────────────────────
UX
────────────────────────

Sticky header that shrinks on scroll.
Anchor navigation.
Modern hover effects.
Clean minimal buttons.

────────────────────────
CODE QUALITY
────────────────────────

Clean structured code.
No unnecessary complexity.
No inline styles unless absolutely required.
Efficient animations.
Readable CSS structure.

────────────────────────
GOAL
────────────────────────

The landing must look like a high-end tech developer portfolio example.
The hero must create strong visual impact even without images.
The page must feel premium and production-ready.
Avoid generic template structure.
Each generation must feel unique in layout and animation logic.

────────────────────────
THEME
────────────────────────

Theme: Mobile App Development Services

Main headline text for hero: "Mobile App Development"

